{"id":10241,"name":"sliggoo-hisui","speciesId":705,"dex":705,"form":"hisuian","generation":6,"types":["steel","dragon"],"stats":{"hp":58,"attack":75,"defense":83,"special-attack":83,"special-defense":113,"speed":40},"abilities":[{"name":"sap-sipper","hidden":false},{"name":"shell-armor","hidden":false},{"name":"gooey","hidden":true}],"height":7,"weight":685,"baseExp":158,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10241.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10241.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10241.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10241.ogg","genus":"Soft Tissue Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon de tecido mole","flavor":[{"version":"x","text":"It drives away opponents by excreting a sticky liquid that can dissolve anything. Its eyes devolved, so it can’t see anything."},{"version":"y","text":"Its four horns are a high-performance radar system. It uses them to sense sounds and smells, rather than using ears or a nose."},{"version":"sun","text":"It has trouble drawing a line between friends and food. It will calmly try to melt and eat even those it gets along well with."},{"version":"moon","text":"This Pokémon’s mucous can dissolve anything. Toothless, it sprays mucous on its prey. Once they’re nicely dissolved, it slurps them up."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It crawls along sluggishly. The swirly protrusion on its back is filled with its brain and other organs."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its entire body is covered with gooey mucus that can dissolve anything. Be sure to put gloves on if you’re going to touch it."},{"version":"sword","text":"Although this Pokémon isn’t very strong, its body is coated in a caustic slime that can melt through anything, so predators steer clear of it."},{"version":"shield","tex